roduce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with his vote. Let's decide: James will maintain his vote for Candidate A, arguing that while A is unfriendly, his leadership and technical abilities outweigh, and B's memory issues could affect attention/accuracy. Also B's pretentious tone is a crew cooperation issue but perhaps less severe. He can request more info about B's memory impact.\n\nHe can also ask a tool question to Sarah or Emily about B's crew cooperation, but that's after his public message. He can incorporate a request for clarification later. For now, produce public message: \"I understand Emily's concerns, but I remain convinced A is best because ...\". Then metadata vote A.\n\nProceed."}
